{"pin":"AB00394","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00394","anchor":"","title":"Lawh-i-Mahfil-i-Shawr?","first_line":"O ye spiritual friends! In these days, most soul-uplifting tidings have reached from that region, for which praise be to God [3.5s]... ...the first condition is absolute love and harmony amongst the members of the assembly.","first_line_orig":"ای یاران رحمانی من در این ایام خبری پر روح و ریحان از آنسامان رسید که الحمد لله  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"610","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_134BE #14 p.548","source":"AKHA_134BE #14 p.548","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK3.409.04x","source":"AVK3","locator":"409.04x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK3/ak3-413.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK4.311x","source":"AVK4","locator":"311x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK4/ak4-315.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"HYB.094","source":"HYB","locator":"094"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MILAN.153","source":"MILAN","locator":"153","url":"https://www.h-net.org/~bahai/areprint/ab/M-R/M/milani/153.jpg"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MKT3.505","source":"MKT3","locator":"505","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MA3/ma3-505.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMG2#373 p.416x","source":"MMG2","locator":"373 p.416x","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMA/mma-419.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#045 p.084x","source":"MMK1","locator":"045 p.084x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/568902986"},{"kind":"publication","code":"YARD.054x","source":"YARD","locator":"054x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-conten